WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:13.680
In autumn the children went to a haunted house.

2
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.660
A witch was making witch sauce.

3
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.910
The witch put straw in the pot.

4
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.560
The witch put sausage in the pot.

5
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.510
The witch put a saw in the pot.

6
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:40.390
The witch put a claw in the pot.

7
00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:47.030
The witch put autumn leaves in the pot.

8
00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:51.970
The witch put a hawk in the pot.

9
00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:56.490
Then the witch caught the children!

10
00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.500
"Now drink my sauce!

11
00:01:02.787 --> 00:01:06.553
Or crawl into the pot!"

12
00:01:09.196 --> 00:01:15.234
"Ah! Ew! It's awful!"

13
00:01:17.063 --> 00:01:44.171
3
